# What each guard weighs in the race job of ci.yml, in seconds under the race
# detector. .github/scripts/race_parts.py lays these out over the parts, the
# heaviest first, and sends every test not named here by the checksum of its
# name, counted at the "unlisted" weight.
#
# Taken on 2026-11-03 from eight parts of two runs, each test at the longest
# time any of them took. The race job runs on whatever processor the runner
# is given, and the same part took 689 s on one and 1202 s on another, every
# test of it slower by the same factor. The longest time is the slowest
# processor's, so the parts are even where they are closest to the timeout.
# Listed: every test that took 10 s or more. "unlisted" is the mean of the rest.
#
# A test that is not here and takes 60 s or more fails its part with the line
# to add. A test that is here and no longer exists fails every part.
